      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "81BF09B554170E22",
      "text": "Eso es",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "81BF08B554170C6F",
      "text": "Te estaba buscando",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_02a",
      "hash64": "53EAF8093C36BE9D",
      "text": "Si es que no hay ninguna tienda como la de la\\nacademia. ¡Tienen de todo aquí![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_02b",
      "hash64": "53EAF5093C36B984",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¿A mí?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_03",
      "hash64": "5575ADBF491CF7C1",
      "text": "Verás, estoy haciendo una evaluación de los\\ndistintos bocadillos que tienen a la venta...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_04",
      "hash64": "5575AEBF491CF974",
      "text": "¡Y he de decir que los bocadillos de aquí tienen\\nmuy buen perfil nutricional y están buenísimos![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_03",
      "hash64": "81BF07B554170ABC",
      "text": "¿Qué pasó con lo de prepararlos tú misma?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_04",
      "hash64": "81BF06B554170909",
      "text": "¿Has dejado el entrenamiento culinario?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_05",
      "hash64": "5575AFBF491CFB27",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! No estoy acostumbrada a ese tipo de\\nentrenamiento, ¡así que he terminado agotada![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_06",
      "hash64": "5575B0BF491CFCDA",
      "text": "Al menos conseguí lo que me propuse, así que\\na partir de ahora me lo tomaré con calma.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_07",
      "hash64": "5575B1BF491CFE8D",
      "text": "¡Ah! ¡Se me olvidó explicarte cuál era mi\\nobjetivo!\\c\\nVerás... Como siempre ando molestando a Mimí\\ncon mis lesiones, quería hacer algo por ella.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_08",
      "hash64": "5575A2BF491CE510",
      "text": "Es la persona más amable que conozco y es muy\\nbuena en lo que hace. ¡La admiro muchísimo![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_09",
      "hash64": "5575A3BF491CE6C3",
      "text": "Como quería que nos llevásemos mejor, pensé\\nen aprender a cocinar para poder ayudar a los\\r\\ndemás de algún modo, como hace ella...\\c\\nPero está claro que todos tenemos cosas que se\\nnos dan mejor o peor.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 203,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_10",
      "hash64": "5578B0BF491F32B1",
      "text": "Con esto he aprendido que mi punto fuerte es mi\\nenergía, así que voy a aprovechar eso al máximo.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_11",
      "hash64": "5578AFBF491F30FE",
      "text": "Como digo en clase: tanto personas como\\nPokémon tenemos que entrenar nuestros puntos\\r\\nfuertes para sacar lo mejor de nosotros mismos.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_12",
      "hash64": "5578AEBF491F2F4B",
      "text": "Me has ayudado mucho, novatill[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.\\nTe regalo esto como agradecimiento.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_13",
      "hash64": "5578ADBF491F2D98",
      "text": "¡Pero mira qué hora es! Toca batido de proteínas.\\n¡Hasta otra![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
